{"timestamp":1774882857067,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"0f55b9ab-b147-4831-8664-94fa8e396555","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_01MvwBgPWFwTG3JQjfHdELHk","payload":{"session_id":"0f55b9ab-b147-4831-8664-94fa8e396555","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-experience-apps-mas-trees-f32e4400/0f55b9ab-b147-4831-8664-94fa8e396555.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/f32e4400","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/f32e4400/specs/patch/patch-adw-11-remove-dead-sandbox.md","content":"# Patch: Remove dead sinon sandbox from generateUniqueFragmentTitle tests\n\n## Metadata\nadw_id: `11`\nreview_change_request: `Issue #1: sinon.createSandbox() is created in beforeEach and sandbox.restore() is called in afterEach for the generateUniqueFragmentTitle test block, but the sandbox is never used to create any stubs, spies, or mocks. This is dead code that misleads readers into thinking something is being mocked. Resolution: Remove sandbox = sinon.createSandbox() and sandbox.restore() from this describe block since no stubs are needed. Severity: tech_debt`\n\n## Issue Summary\n**Original Spec:** specs/feature-adw-11-prevent-duplicate-fragment-title-clone.md\n**Issue:** The `generateUniqueFragmentTitle` describe block declares `let sandbox`, calls `sinon.createSandbox()` in `beforeEach`, and `sandbox.restore()` in `afterEach`, but `sandbox` is never used in any of the 5 tests. This dead code misleads readers into thinking mocking is occurring when it is not.\n**Solution:** Remove the `let sandbox` declaration, `sandbox = sinon.createSandbox()` call, and `sandbox.restore()` call from the `generateUniqueFragmentTitle` describe block.\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `studio/test/mas-repository.test.js` \u2014 remove dead sandbox setup/teardown from `generateUniqueFragmentTitle` describe block (lines 1528, 1532, 1537)\n\n## Implementation Steps\nIMPORTANT: Execute every step in order, top to bottom.\n\n### Step 1: Remove the `let sandbox` declaration\n- In the `generateUniqueFragmentTitle` describe block, remove line `let sandbox;` (line 1528)\n\n### Step 2: Remove sandbox creation from beforeEach\n- Remove `sandbox = sinon.createSandbox();` from the `beforeEach` hook\n- Keep `repository = Object.create(MasRepository.prototype);` intact\n\n### Step 3: Remove sandbox.restore() from afterEach\n- Remove `sandbox.restore();` from the `afterEach` hook\n- Keep `Store.fragments.list.data.set([]);` intact\n\n## Validation\nExecute every command to validate the patch is complete with zero regressions.\n\n1. `node --check studio/test/mas-repository.test.js` \u2014 verify syntax is valid after removal\n2. Confirm `sandbox` does not appear anywhere in the `generateUniqueFragmentTitle` describe block\n\n## Patch Scope\n**Lines of code to change:** 3 lines removed\n**Risk level:** low\n**Testing required:** Node syntax check on the modified test file; no behavioral change expected\n"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MvwBgPWFwTG3JQjfHdELHk"}}
